    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ram in jiäkni jɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, kɛ kui̱ benä Kua̱ran ni Yecu Kritho kɛnɛ matdan guäth kɛl kɛ ɣöö banɛ te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ la̱ŋkɔ yɛ, dämaari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn ɣöö a wuɔ̱thkun /cɛ yi̱c cärädun kiɛ bia dual, kɛ yiëë kiɛ kɛ ruac go̱o̱kä, kiɛ derɛ jɛ lat, kɛ ruac, kiɛ kɛ warɛgak ce̱tkɛ mi bëë kä kɔ. Ce̱tkɛ mi ca lat ɛn ɣöö bi cäŋ Kua̱r Yecu ben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A thil ram mi mɛɛt yɛ kɛ ca̱p dɔ̱diɛn. Kɛ ɣöö /ci Cäŋ ɛmɔ bi ben ɛ ni mi ci gua̱a̱th kacä nath raar kɔŋ ben, kä ci ram in thil ŋut jɔɔc, jɛn ram in ba däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn bɛ mɔ cɔalkɛ mɔ i̱ Kuoth kiɛ mɔ palkɛ mɔ gak, kä bɛ rɔ kap nhial wi̱i̱diɛn diaal. Kä jɛn bä bɛ wä nyuur ni rɛy Luaak Kuɔth, kä bɛ wee ɛ jɛn Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ci yɛn ɛ tim ɛn ɣöö cä yɛ la̱t ti̱ti̱ mëë ŋuɔtdä kɛɛl kɛ yɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋäc yɛn min käp ram ɛmɔ cuɔ̱ŋ ɔ täämɛ, kɛ ɣöö derɛ jɔɔc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ min lot rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ bumä gua̱n jiäkni tëë lät, kä duundɛ ɣöö ram in käp jɛ jɔk täämɛ te thi̱n, amäni mi ca jɛ woc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ, bi ram in thil ŋut cu jɔɔc, kä bi Kuäär ni Yecu jɛ däk kɛ duäŋ thuɔkdɛ, kä bɛ jɛ jakä thil kɛ buay benädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi ram in thil ŋut ben kɛ buɔ̱m Cɛy-tan, kä bɛ nyuuthni ka̱a̱cni ti ŋuan ti ga̱ykɛ naath la̱t, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bɛ pɛl mɛɛtdä jiäkni diaal la̱t kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni ti bi li̱w. Bikɛ li̱w kɛ ɣöö cikɛ nhök thukä lo̱k, min dee kɛ kän. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ci Kuoth kɛ jäkä buɔ̱m mɛɛtdä, kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ jakä ŋa̱th kɛ ni mi mɔ kac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ ba nɛy diaal tin /ka̱n thuɔ̱k ŋäth kä ca nhɔk ni tɛ̈th lɔaacdiɛn kɛ ti /ci tɔ̱ a cuŋ bakɛ kuɛth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kɛ yɛn ti ca mɛk kɛ kui̱ känä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bakɔ Kuoth dhil la̱r tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛ kui̱dun ni ciaŋ, dämaari tin nhɔk Kuäär ni Yecu kɛ, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth yɛ mɛk ni tukä ɣɔaa, kɛ ɣöö ba yɛ kän kɛ lëydun kɛ Yiëë kɛnɛ ŋa̱thdun rɛy thukä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Kuoth yɛ cɔal kä mɛmɛ kɛ thuk ti gɔw tin cakɔ la̱t yɛ, kɛ ɣöö dee yɛn buay Kua̱ran ni Yecu Kritho jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ, dämaari, cuɔ̱ŋɛ a bum, kä ka̱pɛ ŋi̱i̱c in cakɔ nyuɔ̱th yɛ kɛ riet thuɔkda kiɛ warɛgak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ a Kuääran ni Yecu Kritho puɔ̱nydɛ kɛnɛ Kuoth in la Gua̱a̱ra min nhɔk kɔn kä kɛ puɔ̱th cɛ kɔn ka̱m cuum mi do̱raar kɛnɛ ŋa̱th mi gɔaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɔmɛ lo̱ckun, kä akɛ bum, rɛy lätni diaal ti gɔw kɛnɛ ruacni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
